#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "Resource quantities and costs must not be negative."
msgstr "Las cantidades y los costes de los recursos no pueden ser negativos."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "Choose a sales line with a product."
msgstr "Selecciona una línea de venta con producto."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "Resources can only be edited on a quotation."
msgstr "Los recursos solo se pueden editar en un presupuesto."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "The selected sales line must belong to the quotation."
msgstr "La línea de venta seleccionada debe pertenecer al presupuesto."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "Resources cannot be moved to another quotation."
msgstr "No se pueden trasladar recursos a otro presupuesto."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "No sales lines with an available bill of materials and an empty resource list were found."
msgstr "No hay líneas con lista de materiales y sin recursos presupuestados."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "The bill of materials and sales line must use the same unit and the BoM quantity must be positive."
msgstr "La lista de materiales y la línea de venta deben usar la misma unidad; la cantidad de la lista debe ser positiva."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "A bill of materials contains operations. Enter its resource costs manually to avoid omitting operations."
msgstr "Una lista de materiales contiene operaciones. Introduce sus recursos manualmente para no omitirlas."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "A bill of materials has no components."
msgstr "Una lista de materiales no tiene componentes."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "A BoM component uses a different unit than its product. Enter it manually."
msgstr "Un componente usa una unidad distinta a la de su producto. Introdúcelo manualmente."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "Cannot determine the unit of a BoM component."
msgstr "No se puede determinar la unidad de un componente."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "Office overhead must be between 0 and 100 percent."
msgstr "Los gastos de oficina deben estar entre el 0 y el 100 por ciento."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "Office overhead can only be changed on a quotation."
msgstr "El porcentaje de oficina solo se puede modificar en un presupuesto."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "Costs can only be applied on a quotation."
msgstr "Los costes solo pueden aplicarse en un presupuesto."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "Add at least one resource to a positive sales line."
msgstr "Añade al menos un recurso a una línea de venta con cantidad positiva."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "The sales price changed while applying costs. The operation was stopped."
msgstr "El precio de venta ha cambiado al aplicar los costes. Se ha detenido la operación."

#. module: tl_construction_budget_cost
#: code:addons/tl_construction_budget_cost/models/budget_cost.py:0
msgid "A sales manager must confirm quotations containing budget resources."
msgstr "Un responsable de ventas debe confirmar los presupuestos con recursos presupuestados."


